{
  "id": "LEV.22",
  "number": "22",
  "bookId": "LEV",
  "reference": "Abalawi 22",
  "copyright": "© 2021 KENBS",
  "verseCount": 33,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "22",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "LEV 22"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "22",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Obochenu bw’ebing’wanso",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 22:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omonene agakwana na Musa, akamoteebia,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.22.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.22.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 22:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kwana na Aroni na abamura baye, obateebie ng’a barende na bakore amasikani ase ebinto ebichenu, biria Abaisraeli bagwaatanana ase ’nde, erio tibaabaisa korenta obosooku ase erieta riane richenu. Inche ninche Omonene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.22.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.22.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 22:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obateebie ng’a onye omonto onde bwensi ase ororeeria rwabo, ekero are oyotachenegeti; aise goika ang’e n’ebinto ebio Abaisraeli barabe bagwaatanana ase ’nde inche Omonene, omonto oyio naatananwe korwa ase obosio bwane, tagonkorera ase emeremo y’obokuani. Inche ninche Omonene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.22.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.22.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 22:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Omonto onde bwensi ase ororeeria rwa Aroni obwate oborwaire bwa ukoma, gose okorua amaache anga buna chimengere, tabaisa koria ebinto ebichenu goika ekero arabe ochenekire; naboigo na onde bwensi orakune egento getachenegeti, buna egetondo, gose omonto ogosokia embusuro yaye y’oroiboro,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.22.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.22.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 22:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na onde bwensi orakune eng’iti ekwagura, eye eramokore abe oyotachenegeti, gose akune omonto oragere abe oyotachenegeti, ogotacheneka kwaye gakoraabe okw’engencho ende yonsi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.22.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.22.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 22:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omokuani onde bwensi orakune egento buna ekio nabe oyotachenegeti goika omogoroba oyio; ere takoria ebinto ebichenu goika ekero arabe bwesibirie omobere oye namaache.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.22.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.22.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 22:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero erioba riagure, abe ochenekire, na magega y’ayio amanye koria ebinto ebichenu, ekiagera ebinto ebio nabio endagera yaye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.22.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.22.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 22:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Taria enyama y’eng’iti ekwete yoka enyene, gose eye eitire neng’iti ende y’orosana. Aise koria enyama buna eyio, nigo arabe oyotachenegeti. Inche ninche Omonene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.22.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.22.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 22:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Abakuani bonsi goika barende amang’ana aya nachiikire. Batayabwateti, nababe abakori ebibe ase ayio, na barabwo mbakwe, ekiagera bagosaria aya nachiikire. Inche ninche Omonene, ninche nkobachena.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.22.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.22.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 22:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Omonto otari bw’eamate y’Omokuani tabaisa koria ebinto ebichenu. Omomenyi omenyete amo n’Omokuani, gose omonto orikire komokorera emeremo, abwo tibaabaisa koria ebinto ebichenu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.22.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.22.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 22:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omosomba onde bwensi Omokuani agorete ne chitaabu chiaye omonyene, gose omosomba oiboreire ase enka yaye, abwo nabarie endagera eria Omokuani akoegwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.22.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.22.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 22:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omoiseke bw’Omokuani karanyuomwe nomonto otari Omokuani tabaisa koria ebinto ebichenu bikoruegwa bibe ebing’wanso.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.22.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.22.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 22:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende omosubati bw’Omokuani osogete otigirwe ore omoboraka, gose batiganire nomosaacha oye, na tabwati omwana, na bono oiranire gocha o ise komenyao buna ekero areenge omoke, nanyare koria endagera eria ya ise. Korende omonto otari bw’eamate y’Omokuani tabaisa koria endagera eria.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.22.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.22.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 22:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Omonto onde bwensi otari bw’eamate y’Omokuani oraarie ebinto biria ebichenu ase ogotamanya, goika airanie egento egechenu ase Omokuani, buna keria airete, na ameente ensemo ya isano ye rigori ri’egento ekio.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.22.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.22.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 22:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abakuani tibaabaisa gokora ebinto ebi ebichenu Abaisraeli bagwaatanana na kobirua ase Omonene bibe ebitachenegeti,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.22.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.22.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 22:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na igo bakogera abanto babogorie ebibe biabo, na okomocha kwabo, ase okoria ebinto ebichenu baruete. Inche ninche Omonene, ninche nkobachena.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.22.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.22.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 22:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omonene agakwana na Musa, akamoteebia,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.22.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.22.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 22:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Teebia Aroni na abamura baye, na Abaisraeli bonsi, ng’a ekero omonto onde bwensi bw’Abaisraeli, gose omomenyi omenyete ase egati yabo, aganetie konduera inche Omonene ekeng’wanso ki’ogosaambwa, keraabe nase engencho y’eira, gose neki’ogwancha kwaye,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.22.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.22.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 22:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "goika arue eeri, gose egoree, gose emingichi, chitari na kemocho ase emebere yabo, erio nario ekeng’wanso kerancherwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.22.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.22.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 22:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Timobaisa korua eng’iti ende yonsi ere na kemocho ase omobere oye, naki ase ekeng’wanso buna ekio timogwancherwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.22.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.22.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 22:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero omonto onde bwensi akorua ekeng’wanso ki’omorembe ase ’nde, ase engencho y’eira ariete, gose eki’ogwancha kwaye, korwa ase chiombe gose ching’ondi, goika ebe eng’iti eng’ikeranu, etari na kemocho ase omobere oye, eyio nero erancherwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.22.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.22.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 22:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Timobaisa konduera ching’iti chiukorete, gose chire ebisegora, gose ebirema, gose chire namaote akorua amaira, gose chibwate egesuneri, gose amaote, ng’a chibe ekeng’wanso kegosaambwa n’omorero ase egesasiimero.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.22.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.22.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 22:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eeri gose emaanwa y’eng’ondi ebwate ekiimo egetambe goetania ekende, gose ekieng’e mono, nabo oranyare koyerua ebe ekeng’wanso ki’ogwancha, korende ase okoyerua ebe ekeng’wanso ki’ogoikerania eira kwariete, tegwancherwa nainche.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.22.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.22.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 22:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eng’iti ende yonsi chingetia chiaye chisaregete ase ogosunyuntwa, gose ase okomiorigwa, gose ase okobutorwa, gose ase okonatwa, timobaisa koyerua ebe ekeng’wanso ase ’nde. Timokora igo ase ense yaino.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.22.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.22.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 22:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Eng’iti ende yonsi ere buna echio moranyore korwa ase omomenyi, timobaisa koyerua ebe okoruegwa kw’endagera ase ’nde. Echio nigo chire nebimocho ase emebere yabo, na ase ebing’wanso buna ebio timogwancherwa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.22.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.22.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 22:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naende Omonene agakwana na Musa, akamoteebia,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.22.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.22.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 22:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ekero emori, gose emaanwa y’eng’ondi, gose ey’embori, yabiarirwe, etigwe ebe ase eng’ina ase engaki y’amatuko atano na abere, korende korwa ase rituko ria gatano na gatato yancherwe ebe ekeng’wanso kegosaambwa n’omorero ase ’nde.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.22.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.22.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 22:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Timobaisa konyenya eng’ombe amo nemori yaye ase rituko erimo, gose eng’ondi, gose embori amo ne chimanwa chiabo ase rituko erimo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.22.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.22.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 22:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero moganetie konduera inche Omonene ekeng’wanso ki’ogoaka ng’a mbuya mono, mokerue ase enchera endonge, erinde monyare gwancherwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.22.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.22.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 22:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekeng’wanso ekio keriegwe keere ase rituko erio erio, tigetigara nonya ngesinini goika rituko ria kabere. Inche ninche Omonene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.22.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.22.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
